<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Glodina falls into loss in first half.</title>
<headline>Glodina falls into loss in first half.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     6.9 loss    vs 11.3 profit</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  -	    vs  -</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.59 loss   vs 2.23 profit</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   1.56 loss   vs 2.80 profit</p>
<p>Tax</p>
<p>    - current year	   -	    vs 0.57</p>
<p>    - prior year	    0.02	  vs  -</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   3.05	  vs 1.66</p>
<p>    Turnover		 44.46	  vs 46.90</p>
<p>Full name: Glodina Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Clothing firm Glodina said it was hit by severe delays in its factory upgrade. However, projects have now been completed and the company predicted a profit for the second half.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
